  "body": "## What is missing\n\n`fanuc-lathe.cps` posts the in-pass chip-break dips of #419. The Tormach\nlathe post does not. Its machine file has no `continuousThreading` key, so\nthe post refuses dipped threads by name.\n\n## Expected behaviour\n\nAdd the thread-dip path to `assets/posts/tormach-lathe.cps` when the\ncontroller mode supports a continuous threading pass. Refuse by name when\nit does not. Keep the refusal text clear.\n\n## Where this came from\n\nWork on #363 found the gap. The dips themselves are on main with tests\n(`lathe_post_thread_dips`).\n\nRefs #363\n",
